  "_about": "Starting visual directions. Each look = palette (bg/fg/accent), a system-safe type stack, and a motion personality. font is a system stack (the fallback); bundledFont is the open-licence font each look ships when motionmaker-libs fonts are installed (scaffold.sh copies it into the project), with its own measured glyphWidth. Every palette was checked with scripts/palette.mjs (text >= 4.5:1, accent >= 3:1). glyphWidth = average advance of a character in em (bold weight), used to size one-line headlines so they fit; measure a new font by rendering text and dividing width by (characters x font size).",
